{
  "info": {
    "name": "PMAP API",
    "description": "Colección de endpoints para la Plataforma de Aprendizaje PMAP\n\n## Variables de colección\n- `{{base_url}}`: `http://localhost:8080/api`\n- `{{token}}`: se asigna automáticamente al iniciar sesión (script en Tests de Login)\n\n## Flujo de uso\n1. Ejecutar **Login** o **Register** para obtener el token\n2. El resto de endpoints requieren el token (se envía automáticamente vía header Authorization)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticación",
      "description": "Endpoints públicos para registro e inicio de sesión",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombres\": \"Juan\",\n  \"apellidos\": \"Pérez\",\n  \"correo\": \"juan@pmap.com\",\n  \"contraseña\": \"Password123\",\n  \"rol\": \"ESTUDIANTE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Iniciar sesión",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jsonData.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"admin@pmap.com\",\n  \"contraseña\": \"Password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Usuarios",
